### Nihon Planner API — colección HTTP
### Base: http://localhost:8787
@base = http://localhost:8787/api/v1
@credential = PASTE_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE

### Health (público)
GET {{base}}/../health
# o:
GET http://localhost:8787/health

### Auth — login Google
POST {{base}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": "{{credential}}"
}

### Auth — me
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Auth — logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout

### Gastos — listar
GET {{base}}/expenses

### Gastos — crear
POST {{base}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Ramen Ichiran",
  "amount": 1200,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "category": "comida",
  "spent_at": "2026-07-15T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### Gastos — totales
GET {{base}}/expenses/totals

### Gastos — dashboard (KPIs Resumen)
GET {{base}}/expenses/dashboard

### Gastos — doc sin monto (checklist)
POST {{base}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Visit Japan Web",
  "amount": null,
  "currency": null,
  "category": "documentacion",
  "kind": "doc",
  "done": false
}

### Gastos — vuelo con monto
POST {{base}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "EZE → NRT",
  "amount": 1800,
  "currency": "USD",
  "category": "vuelos",
  "kind": "flight",
  "datetime_start": "2026-10-01T22:00:00.000Z",
  "meta": { "code": "LA800" },
  "done": false
}

### Gastos — actualizar
PUT {{base}}/expenses/ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1300,
  "done": true
}

### Gastos — borrar
DELETE {{base}}/expenses/ID

### plan-items (DEPRECADO escritura; GET lee desde expenses)
GET {{base}}/plan-items?format=logistics

### Itinerario — get
GET {{base}}/itinerary

### Itinerario — meta (ancla opcional)
PUT {{base}}/itinerary/meta
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Itinerario Fito — Japón",
  "anchor_date": "2026-04-05"
}

### Itinerario — crear día
POST {{base}}/itinerary/days
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "day_number": 1,
  "title": "Arribo",
  "base": "Tokyo",
  "stay_label": "Ikebukuro",
  "hub": "Ikebukuro",
  "notes": ""
}

### Itinerario — import MD (AI)
POST {{base}}/itinerary/import-md
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "plan.example.md",
  "markdown": "# Día 1\n\n**Alojamiento:** Ikebukuro\n\n#### Paradas\n\n| # | Parada | Detalle |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Ikebukuro | Check-in |\n"
}

### Itinerario — import JSON (sin AI)
POST {{base}}/itinerary/import-json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test",
  "anchor_date": null,
  "days": [
    {
      "day_number": 1,
      "title": "Arribo",
      "base": "Tokyo",
      "stay_label": "Ikebukuro",
      "hub": "Ikebukuro",
      "notes": "",
      "stops": [
        { "kind": "stop", "name": "Check-in", "detail": "", "how_to_get": "", "est_duration": "", "notes": "" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Itinerario — export MD
GET {{base}}/itinerary/export.md

### Rates — get
GET {{base}}/rates

### Rates — manual
PUT {{base}}/rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usdArs": 1350,
  "usdJpy": 155
}

### Rates — refresh
POST {{base}}/rates/refresh

### Rates — refresh force
POST {{base}}/rates/refresh?force=true

### Sessions — listar
GET {{base}}/sessions

### Sessions — crear
POST {{base}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "planificar",
  "name": "Itinerario Kyoto"
}

### Sessions — renombrar
PATCH {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruta Tokio y Kyoto"
}

### Sessions — chat
POST {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "¿Cuántos días conviene en Kyoto?"
}

### Sessions — mensajes
GET {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID/messages

### Sessions — reset
POST {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID/reset

### Sessions — export
GET {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID/export

### Sessions — borrar
DELETE {{base}}/sessions/SESSION_ID

### Search FTS
GET {{base}}/search?q=kyoto

### Import artifact / localStorage dump
POST {{base}}/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "herramienta": "nihon-planner",
  "version": 1,
  "tipo": "planificacion",
  "sesion": {
    "id": "s1",
    "nombre": "Import test",
    "mensajes": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "hola" },
      { "role": "assistant", "content": "hola!" }
    ]
  }
}

### Backup DB
GET {{base}}/admin/backup
